# This board's vendor U-Boot keeps its device tree where OpenIPC keeps the
# U-Boot environment: 64 KiB at 0x40000, and the environment itself is 0x1000
# bytes at 0x3c000, which fw_printenv never looks at. Point it at a file
# instead: /etc/ws03.env is a 4 KiB environment image carried in the rootfs,
# so fw_printenv and fw_setenv work and flash is never written.
/etc/ws03.env 0x0 0x1000
